                                "sense_id": "4a8baca3-0a0f-3a9b-9910-773bf26515a0",
                                "text": "A piece of Maries hair is misparted, tucked behind her ear."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "77d458e3-ac9c-4aba-9c85-e7549084d5fe",
                                "sense_id": "4a8baca3-0a0f-3a9b-9910-773bf26515a0",
                                "text": "Tom's hair was misparted and stood out in places."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7ec01b2c-0b9c-490f-9ddc-f5daa2cd35d9",
                                "sense_id": "4a8baca3-0a0f-3a9b-9910-773bf26515a0",
                                "text": "And Chris, (gina sighs), did her momma ever teach her how to part her hair or does she mispart it on purpose?"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
